  <description>Contract beasts for witcher hunts. Adds custom monsters that are never tameable and meant for future witcher contract quests.

Currently includes the leshen — a dormant forest spirit that stirs when intruders draw near, then teleports through the trees and fights at range with Gorehulk-style spine launches and wolf summons.</description>
